      "nonstandard_elements": "Reported a vivid early-childhood memory scene (in a highchair next to twin sister; refused carrots; detailed house layout) occurring between tunnel and arrival in the 'beautiful place.' Also separately described an unusual experience during a later back fusion surgery (felt doctor's warmth, no pain, tried to leave through doors, ended up at fire exit/refreshment room), but did not explicitly frame it as an NDE/OBE.",
